            <h3>
                <span class="title"><a target="_parent" href="/coa/coa/en/item/24435/index.do?q=%22Crown+Liability+and+Proceedings+Act%2C+2019%22">Minotar Holdings Inc. v. Ontario (Municipal Affairs and Housing)</a></span>
                        - <span class="citation">2026 ONCA 606</span>
