                    The <b>Crown Liability and Proceedings Act, 2019</b>, S.O. 2019, c. 7, Sched. 17 (“CLPA”), came into force on July 1, 2019, repealing the PACA. The repeal and replacement of the PACA does not imply anything about the previous state of the law: Legislation Act, 2006, S.O. 2006, c. 21, Sched. 
